20
00:00:31,751 --> 00:00:33,212
Júpiter Stator, el que detiene.

21
00:00:34,033 --> 00:00:35,954
Y en Virgilio, Júpiter promete a Roma

22
00:00:35,754 --> 00:00:36,805
un imperio sin fin.

23
00:00:37,581 --> 00:00:39,328
El Zeus de Hesíodo reina porque los

24
00:00:39,128 --> 00:00:40,260
